/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (DevYatra is a unified digital platform developed to manage crowds efficiently and enrich the pilgrimage experience at major temple sites. It brings together streamlined entry processes, timely information, user-friendly guidance, and easy access to emergency help. Designed for practical usability, DevYatra aims to support both visitors and authorities, while being easy to implement and respectful of local traditions.)
